.json\" file:\nAdd the following in the policies section:\n\"DisablePocket\": true","group_tree":{"title":"SRG-APP-000141","id":"V-252908"},"legacy_ids":[],"potential_impacts":""},{"group_id":"V-252909","ccis":["CCI-000381"],"false_positives":"","weight":"10.0","third_party_tools":"","rule_title":"Firefox Studies must be disabled.","ia_controls":"","check_content_ref":{"name":"oval:navy.navwar.niwcatlantic.scc.firefox.windows:def:252909","href":"U_MOZ_Firefox_Windows_V6R7_STIG_SCAP_1-4_Benchmark-enhancedV12-oval2.xml"},"check_content":"Type \"about:policies\" in the browser address bar. \n\nIf \"DisableFirefoxStudies\" is not displayed under Policy Name or the Policy Value does not have a value of \"true\", this is a finding.","classification":"Unclassified","group_title":"SRG-APP-000141","severity":"medium","group_id_src":"V-252909","status":"not_a_finding","stig_uuid":"93E2B29A-6BF8-1014-B7B8-F59365D05FB5","mitigations":"","rule_id":"SV-252909r960963","reference_identifier":"5446","documentable":"false","potential_impacts":"","legacy_ids":[],"group_tree":{"title":"SRG-APP-000141","id":"V-252909"},"fix_text":"Windows group policy:\n1. Open the group policy editor tool with \"gpedit.msc\".\n2. Navigate to Policy Path: Computer Configuration\\Administrative Templates\\Mozilla\\Firefox\nPolicy Name: Disable Firefox Studies\nPolicy State: Enabled\n\nmacOS \"plist\" file:\n&lt;key&gt;DisableFirefoxStudies&lt;/key&gt;\n &lt;true/&gt;\n\nLinux \"policies.json\" file:\nAdd the following in the policies section:\n\"DisableFirefoxStudies\": true","rule_id_src":"SV-252909r960963_rule","responsibility":"","security_override_guidance":"","uuid":"93E7E6FA-6BF8-1014-A40D-9F2D7C339068","comments":null,"rule_version":"FFOX-00-000039","finding_details":"Tool: cpe:/a:niwc:scc:5.14.1\nTime         : 2026-09-05T10:13:23\nResult: passRule Result             : Pass\nCriteria                : true (All child tests must be true. (AND))\nTest                    :   true (Firefox Studies mus